// Macros emitted as no constant (name: kind)
//   SQLITE_API: empty definition (linkage or attribute marker)
//   SQLITE_APICALL: empty definition (linkage or attribute marker)
//   SQLITE_CALLBACK: empty definition (linkage or attribute marker)
//   SQLITE_CDECL: empty definition (linkage or attribute marker)
//   SQLITE_DEPRECATED: empty definition (linkage or attribute marker)
//   SQLITE_EXPERIMENTAL: empty definition (linkage or attribute marker)
//   SQLITE_EXTERN: no integer constant: clang: expected expression
//   SQLITE_SCM_BRANCH: string literal (char[6])
//   SQLITE_SCM_DATETIME: string literal (char[25])
//   SQLITE_SCM_TAGS: string literal (char[37])
//   SQLITE_SOURCE_ID: string literal (char[85])
//   SQLITE_STATIC: function-pointer sentinel (sqlite3_destructor_type)0, a constant_parameters value for a parameter of that type
//   SQLITE_STDCALL: no integer constant: clang: expected expression
//   SQLITE_SYSAPI: empty definition (linkage or attribute marker)
//   SQLITE_TRANSIENT: function-pointer sentinel (sqlite3_destructor_type)-1, a constant_parameters value for a parameter of that type
//   SQLITE_VERSION: string literal (char[7])
